      "text": "size of one pixel of viewport\n-> (one pixel of world will be how\nmany part of viewport).\n16/1920 and 9/1080\n16 units divided into 1920 parts.\n9 units divided into 1080 parts.\ntherefore one pixel is 0.833.. units wide\nand 0.833.. units long",
